            72.0,
            311.74,
            501.42,
            323.7
          ],
          "intersectsDrawing": false,
          "fonts": [
            "CMR12"
          ],
          "sizes": [
            11.96
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "It has been known for some time that the precision measurements of the standard model",
          "bbox": [
            89.56,
            333.39,
            540.03,
            345.34
          ],
          "intersectsDrawing": false,
          "fonts": [
            "CMR12"
          ],
          "sizes": [
            11.96
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "coupling constants (in particular sin2θW) at LEP put severe constraints on the idea of",
          "bbox": [
            72.0,
            346.61,
            540.02,
            360.71
          ],
          "intersectsDrawing": false,
          "fonts": [
            "CMMI12",
            "CMR12",
            "CMR8"
          ],
          "sizes": [
            7.97,
            11.96
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "grand uniﬁcation.",
          "bbox": [
            72.0,
            362.28,
            164.17,
            374.24
          ],
          "intersectsDrawing": false,
          "fonts": [
            "CMR12"
          ],
          "sizes": [
            11.96
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Owing to these constraints, the non-supersymmetric minimal SU(5),",
          "bbox": [
            174.64,
            362.28,
            540.01,
            374.24
          ],
          "intersectsDrawing": false,
          "fonts": [
            "CMMI12",
            "CMR12"
          ],
          "sizes": [
            11.96
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "and for similar reasons, the one-step breaking minimal non-supersymmetric SO(10)-model",
          "bbox": [
            72.0,
            376.73,
            540.01,
            388.68
          ],
          "intersectsDrawing": false,
          "fonts": [
            "CMMI12",
            "CMR12",
            "CMTI12"
          ],
          "sizes": [
            11.96
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "as well, are now excluded[80]. For example, minimal non-supersymmetric SU(5) predicts:",
